{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13102350","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13102350","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1310235001:0":{"text":"제전은 정말 재미있어요! 눈사람을 만들든, 눈싸움을 하든, 스케이트든 다 재미있어서 “눈사람 쫓기”에서 약간의 실수가 있었다고 해도 짜릿하네요!","source_cn":"祭典太有趣了！不管是堆雪人打雪仗还是滑冰都很好玩，就算...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x960B5C6DA7A31F0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310235002:0":{"text":"그렇죠? 저도 겨울 제전이 가장 재미있는 기념일이라고 생각해요!","source_cn":"对吧？我一直觉得冬日祭典是整个公国最好玩的节日！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89E2BEBA9AB2606D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310235003:0":{"text":"다들 마음에 든다니, 정말 다행이에요!","source_cn":"你们也喜欢，真是太好了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFA32D4B96593A65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310235004:0":{"text":"하지만 제전에서 가장 재미있고, 가장 흥분되고, 가장 인기 많은 종목은 아직 체험하지 못했네요!","source_cn":"不过，祭典里最有趣、最刺激、最受欢迎的项目你们还没体验到呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x519E4DD71A01D4F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310235005:0":{"text":"뭔데요, 뭔데요? 아직 경험하지 못한 게 있나요? 공주님께서 말씀하신 종목이 뭔가요?","source_cn":"什么什么？还有我们没玩到的？公主殿下，你说的是什么项目？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9156338C9957A518","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310235006:0":{"text":"직접 말하면 재미없죠! 자, 따라오세요! 제가 <style=\"highlight\">게시판</style>에 광고를 보여 드릴 테니, 어떤 종목인지 한 번 맞춰 봐요!","source_cn":"直接说出来多没意思！跟我来，我带你们去<style=h...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6C0C19640494785","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310235007:0":{"text":"헛!! 치피 벌써부터 너무너무 궁금해요!","source_cn":"这么神秘？满满已经开始好奇了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B6C28B7F87B5F6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:亚莲娜公主":{"text":"알레나 공주","source":"亚莲娜公主","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}